From: Max Filippov <jcmvbkbc@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Oct 2024 14:47:16 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 47/73] fbtft/fb_ili9341: add y axis inversion

Signed-off-by: Max Filippov <jcmvbkbc@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit 76a73a5a31f554ea7fc005bcac77d7e4c998b65a)
---
 drivers/staging/fbtft/fb_ili9341.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/staging/fbtft/fb_ili9341.c b/drivers/staging/fbtft/fb_ili9341.c
index 428922dee9f90..f50abc225063f 100644
--- a/drivers/staging/fbtft/fb_ili9341.c
+++ b/drivers/staging/fbtft/fb_ili9341.c
@@ -76,7 +76,7 @@ static int set_var(struct fbtft_par *par)
 	switch (par->info->var.rotate) {
 	case 0:
 		write_reg(par, MIPI_DCS_SET_ADDRESS_MODE,
-			  MEM_X | (par->bgr << MEM_BGR));
+			  MEM_Y | MEM_X | (par->bgr << MEM_BGR));
 		break;
 	case 270:
 		write_reg(par, MIPI_DCS_SET_ADDRESS_MODE,
